{"question": "How must a system be configured to handle consecutive invalid logon attempts?", "framework_version": "rev5", "answer_text": "The system must enforce a limit of consecutive invalid logon attempts and automatically take action when the limit is exceeded.", "answer_text_with_citations": "The system must enforce a limit of consecutive invalid logon attempts and automatically take action when the limit is exceeded.

