{"question": "What should be analyzed before implementing a system change?", "framework_version": "rev5", "answer_text": "Security and privacy impact analyses should be considered.", "answer_text_with_citations": "Security and privacy impact analyses should be considered.

Citations: cm-3_smt.b, cm-3_gdn (NIST SP 800-53 Rev. 5)", "evidence_spans": [{"source_id": "cm-3_smt.b", "span_text": "Review proposed configuration-controlled changes to the system and approve or disapprove such changes with explicit consideration for security and privacy impact analyses;"}, {"source_id": "cm-3_gdn", "span_text": "Configuration change control for organizational systems involves the systematic proposal, justification, implementation, testing, review, and disposition of system changes, including system upgrades and modifications. Configuration change control includes changes to baseline configurations, configuration items of systems, operational procedures, configuration settings for system components, remediate vulnerabilities, and unscheduled or unauthorized changes. Processes for managing configuration changes to systems include Configuration Control Boards or Change Advisory Boards that review and approve proposed changes. For changes that impact privacy risk, the senior agency official for privacy updates privacy impact assessments and system of records notices. For new systems or major upgrades, organizations consider including representatives from the development organizations on the Configuration Control Boards or Change Advisory Boards. Auditing of changes includes activities before and after changes are made to systems and the auditing activities required to implement such changes. See also [SA-10](#sa-10)."}], "status": "OK", "odp_required_list": [], "ask_list": [], "primary_citation": "cm-3_smt.b", "all_citations": "cm-3_smt.b, cm-3_gdn", "contract_mode": "generative_rag_baseline", "debug": {"query_plan": {"original_query": "What should be analyzed before implementing a system change?", "rewrites": ["What technical components need assessment prior to executing a system modification?", "What aspects should be evaluated before a system update is deployed?", "Which factors require analysis before a system alteration is implemented?"]}, "retr