{"question": "How should configuration settings be established, approved, and monitored?", "framework_version": "rev5", "answer_text": "Configuration settings should be established and documented using the most restrictive mode consistent with operational requirements. Any deviations from these settings must be identified, documented, and approved based on organizational policies and procedures. Changes to configuration settings should be monitored and controlled according to organizational policies and procedures.", "answer_text_with_citations": "Configuration settings should be established and documented using the most restrictive mode consistent with operational requirements. Any deviations from these settings must be identified, documented, and approved based on organizational policies and procedures. Changes to configuration settings should be monitored and controlled according to organizational policies and procedures.

