{"question": "What are the requirements for establishing and maintaining an alternate processing site to resume essential operations?", "framework_version": "rev5", "answer_text": "Establish an alternate processing site, including necessary agreements to permit the transfer and resumption of essential mission and business functions within a specified time period when the primary processing capabilities are unavailable. Ensure that the alternate processing site provides controls equivalent to those at the primary site. Prepare the alternate processing site so that it can serve as the operational site supporting essential mission and business functions. Plan and prepare for circumstances that preclude returning to the primary processing site.", "answer_text_with_citations": "Establish an alternate processing site, including necessary agreements to permit the transfer and resumption of essential mission and business functions within a specified time period when the primary processing capabilities are unavailable. Ensure that the alternate processing site provides controls equivalent to those at the primary site. Prepare the alternate processing site so that it can serve as the operational site supporting essential mission and business functions. Plan and prepare for circumstances that preclude returning to the primary processing site.

