{"question": "What are the key elements of implementing an effective incident handling capability, including coordination and lessons learned?", "framework_version": "rev5", "answer_text": "Implement an incident handling capability that includes preparation, detection and analysis, containment, eradication, and recovery. Coordinate incident handling activities with contingency planning activities and ensure the rigor, intensity, scope, and results are comparable and predictable across the organization. Incorporate lessons learned from ongoing incident handling activities into incident response procedures, training, and testing, and implement the resulting changes accordingly.", "answer_text_with_citations": "Implement an incident handling capability that includes preparation, detection and analysis, containment, eradication, and recovery. Coordinate incident handling activities with contingency planning activities and ensure the rigor, intensity, scope, and results are comparable and predictable across the organization. Incorporate lessons learned from ongoing incident handling activities into incident response procedures, training, and testing, and implement the resulting changes accordingly.

Citations: ir-4_smt, ir-4_smt.b, ir-4_smt.c, ir-4_smt.d (NIST SP 800-53 Rev. 5)", "evidence_spans": [{"source_id": "ir-4_smt", "span_text": "a. Implement an incident handling capability for incidents that is consistent with the incident response plan and includes preparation, detection and analysis, containment, eradication, and recovery; b. Coordinate incident handling activities with contingency planning activities; c. Incorporate lessons learned from ongoing incident handling activities into incident response procedures, training, and testing, and implement the resulting changes accordingly; and d. Ensure the rigor, intensity, scope, and results of incident handling activities are comparable and predictable across the organization."}, {"source_id": "ir-4_smt.b", "span_text": "Coordinate incident handling activities with contingency planning activities;"}, {"source_id": "ir-4_smt.c", "span_text": "Incorporate lessons learned from ongoing incident handling activities into incident response procedures, training, and testing, and implement the resulting changes accordingly; and"}, {"source_id": "ir-4_smt.d", "span_text": "Ensure the rigor, intensity, scope, and results of incident handling activities are comparable and predictable across the organization."}], "status": "OK", "odp_required_list": [], "ask_list": [], "primary_citation": "ir-4_smt", "all_citations": "ir-4_smt, ir-4_smt.b, ir-4_smt.c, ir-4_smt.d", "contract_mode": "generative_rag_baseline", "debug": {"query_plan": {"original_query": "What are the key elements of implementing an effective incident handling capability, including coordination and lessons learned?", "rewrites": ["What are the essential components for establishing a robust incident response process that includes coordination and post-incident analysis?", "How can one effectively set up an incident handling framework that involves coordination and learning from past incidents?", "Can you outline the critical aspects of building an efficient in