cial for prioritizing protection activities and assessing the impact of component or function failures on organizational missions. The analysis should be conducted when developing, modifying, or upgrading an architecture or design, and at specific decision points in the system development life cycle.", "cited_source_ids": ["ra-9_gdn", "sa-15.3_gdn"], "odp_required_list": [], "raw_output": "{
