{"question": "What measures should be implemented to protect the confidentiality and integrity of transmitted information across internal and external networks?", "framework_version": "rev5", "answer_text": "Implement cryptographic mechanisms to protect message externals and establish traffic flow policies for each managed interface. Additionally, monitor and control communications at external managed interfaces and ensure that subnetworks for publicly accessible system components are separated from internal organizational networks.", "answer_text_with_citations": "Implement cryptographic mechanisms to protect message externals and establish traffic flow policies for each managed interface. Additionally, monitor and control communications at external managed interfaces and ensure that subnetworks for publicly accessible system components are separated from internal organizational networks.

Citations: sc-8.3_smt, sc-7.4_smt, sc-7_smt (NIST SP 800-53 Rev. 5)", "evidence_spans": [{"source_id": "sc-8.3_smt", "span_text": "Implement cryptographic mechanisms to protect message externals unless otherwise protected by {{ insert: param, sc-08.03_odp }}."}, {"source_id": "sc-7.4_smt", "span_text": "(a) Implement a managed interface for each external telecommunication service; (b) Establish a traffic flow policy for each managed interface; (c) Protect the confidentiality and integrity of the information being transmitted across each interface; (d) Document each exception to the traffic flow policy with a supporting mission or business need and duration of that need; (e) Review exceptions to the traffic flow policy {{ insert: param, sc-07.04_odp }} and remove exceptions that are no longer supported by an explicit mission or business need; (f) Prevent unauthorized exchange of control plane traffic with external networks; (g) Publish information to enable remote networks to detect unauthorized control plane traffic from internal networks; and (h) Filter unauthorized control plane traffic from external networks."}, {"source_id": "sc-7_smt", "span_text": "a. Monitor and control communications at the external managed interfaces to the system and at key internal managed interfaces within the system; b. Implement subnetworks for publicly accessible system components that are {{ insert: param, sc-07_odp }} separated from internal organizational networks; and c. Connect to external networks or systems only through managed interfaces consisting of boundary protection devices arranged in accordance with an organizational security and privacy architecture."}], "status": "OK", "odp_required_list": [], "ask_list": [], "primary_citation": "sc-8.3_smt", "all_citations": "sc-8.3_smt, sc-7.4_smt, sc-7_smt", "contract_mode": "generative_rag_baseline", "debug": {"query_plan": {"original_query": "What measures should be implemented to protect the confidentiality and integrity of tran